<p>The Confederation of African Football said on Tuesday that it had overturned the result of the 2025 Africa Cup of Nations final and awarded the title to Morocco instead of Senegal. The ruling reverses Senegal&#x27;s 1-0 win in the final in Rabat after CAF judges upheld Morocco&#x27;s protest, with the BBC reporting that the title was reassigned as a 3-0 result for Morocco. The decision gives Morocco its second AFCON crown. Senegal plans to appeal, so the dispute may continue through further legal or disciplinary channels even as Morocco celebrates the new verdict.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Delayed verdict: NPR said the final was played in January, so CAF&#x27;s ruling came more than two months after the match.</li><li>Chaotic ending: NPR described the showpiece as chaotic, suggesting the dispute grew out of disorder late in the match.</li><li>Host-nation reversal: The ruling handed the trophy to tournament hosts Morocco after the home side had originally lost the final in Rabat.</li><li>Shock factor: NPR said Morocco was &#x27;stunningly&#x27; awarded the title, underscoring how unexpected the judges&#x27; intervention was.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>CAF: CAF said it made the ruling under its regulations and treated the outcome as a formal administrative reversal of the final. (<a href='https://allafrica.com/stories/202603180001.html'>allAfrica / Premium Times</a>)</li><li>Morocco: Morocco went from on-field runner-up to champion after CAF judges changed the official outcome of the January final. (<a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/03/18/g-s1-114255/ruling-africa-cup-morocco-champion'>NPR</a>)</li><li>Senegal: Senegal plans to appeal, signaling that it rejects CAF&#x27;s administrative reassignment of the title. (<a href='https://www.dw.com/en/afcon-senegal-stripped-of-title-morocco-crowned-champions/a-76402922'>DW</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://allafrica.com/stories/202603180001.html'>Africa: CAF Strips Senegal of Afcon 2025 Title, Awards It to Morocco</a> - allafrica.com</li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch'>AFCON: Senegal stripped of title as Morocco&#x27;s appeal is upheld by CAF • FRANCE 24 English</a> - youtube.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/afcon-senegal-stripped-of-title-morocco-crowned-champions/a-76402922'>AFCON: Senegal stripped of title, Morocco crowned champions</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/03/18/g-s1-114255/ruling-africa-cup-morocco-champion'>Ruling overturns Senegal&#x27;s Africa Cup title and declares Morocco the champion</a> - npr.org</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/football/articles/ce949glzzglo'>In association football, the Confederation of African Football formally overturns the result of the 2025 Africa Cup of Nations final in which Senegal won 1–0 over hosts Morocco due to a controversial walk-off by Senagalese players during extra-time. Morocco are awarded the title with a 3–0 win, their second title win.</a> - bbc.co.uk</li></ul>